{
    "title": "Call Santa Claus - Prank Call",
    "description": "Please note: All voice and video calls are simulated experiences.\r\nParents, the Call Santa Claus - Prank Call app is a fantastic app to encourage good behaviors in your children all year! Engage with them in this fun simulator!\r\n\r\nSimulate a Video Call with Santa Claus! Simulate a Voice Call! Simulate a Message with Santa Claus! You can even track Santa's journey! This unique Call Santa Claus - Prank Call app offers diverse and customizable conversation options. For the first time, simulate a Video Call with Santa! He knows details like your name, favorite color, and favorite sport. Santa even keeps track of whether you've been naughty or nice, and he might mention it during your call!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf85\ud83c\udffb FEATURES\r\n\r\n- GET A CALL FROM SANTA CLAUS \ud83d\udcde\r\nMake Christmas more exciting with this playful Santa call app. Wondering how to call Santa? Just use this app for a fake Santa call. Pretend to talk to Santa and trick others with this convincing Santa Call Simulation. Experience a believable call from Santa with options to answer or ignore the call, as if Santa himself is really on the line! When Santa calls, you'll hear his jolly \"HO HO HO!!\" and a festive \"MERRY CHRISTMAS!\".\r\n\r\n- FAKE VIDEO CALL FROM SANTA \ud83d\udcf9\r\nSurprise your friends with a video call from Santa using this prank app. With the \"video call option,\" choose from 7 different charming Santa characters (including a kitty Santa) for your call.\r\nMake a call to Santa in your leisure time, before bedtime, or even before heading to work.\r\n\r\n- CHAT WITH SANTA \ud83d\udde8\r\nEnjoy more Santa pranks and bring smiles with messages from Santa and the North Pole.\r\n\r\nThe Call Santa Claus - Prank Call app brings the festive spirit directly to your phone. Whether you're receiving a jolly call from Santa or sending festive messages, this app ensures a magical and joyful experience for the whole family. Don't miss out on the holiday fun! Download the Call Santa Claus - Prank Call app now!\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: This app is designed solely for entertainment. All calls and messages are simulated. The app does not offer real calling or texting. It's free to use, though some features might require an in-app purchase.",
